{% capture tags %}
[
  {%- for item in data.tags -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      Kept for tags.json files published by OLDER platform versions, which is where a blank
      entry can still come from: the generator used to serialize a class with no `@tag_name` as
      `""`, and this line is what made the resulting gap invisible. Current builds cannot
      produce one — the generator raises, and `verify_tags_json.rb` fails the build against the
      tag registry — so this is compatibility with what CloudFront already holds, not a guard
      against today's generator.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {% if item.name == blank %}{% continue %}{% endif %}
    {
      "category": "{{ item.category | default: 'platformOS' }}",
      {%- comment -%}
        `deprecated` is a boolean and `deprecated_reason` is the text, both straight from the
        generator. This used to read `deprecation_reason` off `item.deprecated`, which is not
        the reason — a deprecated tag published `deprecation_reason: "true"` while `deprecated`
        itself stayed false, so consumers saw a tag that was deprecated in one field and
        current in the other.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      "deprecated": {{ item.deprecated | default: false | json }},
      "deprecation_reason": {{ item.deprecated_reason | default: '' | json }},
      {%- comment -%}
        The successor's registered NAME, for a consumer that acts on the deprecation instead of
        displaying it: platformos-check renames a deprecated tag to it and, under
        `pos-cli check run -a`, writes the result to the user's file unattended. It used to
        read that name out of `deprecation_reason` — English prose — so rephrasing a sentence
        moved the rename, or turned it off. Blank for a tags.json published by an older
        platform version, which is the same fallback path the reason still serves.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      "deprecation_replacement": {{ item.deprecated_replacement | default: '' | json }},
      "description": {{ item.description | json }},
      "syntax": {{ item.syntax | json }},
      "platformOS": true,
      "name": "{{item.name}}",
      "parameters": [
        {% for param in item.params %}
          {
          "description": {{ param.description | json }},
            "name": {{ param.name | json }},
            "required": {{ param.required | default: false | json }},
            "types": ["untyped"]
          }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
        {% endfor %}
      ],
      "return_type": [
        {% for return_type in item.returns %}
          {
            "types": ["untyped"],
            "name": "",
            "description": {{return_type.description | json }},
            "array_value": ""
          }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
        {% endfor %}
      ],
      "examples": [
        {% for example in item.examples %}
          {
            "name": "",
            "description": "",
            "syntax": "",
            "path": "",
            "raw_liquid": {{ example | json }},
            "parameter": false,
            "display_type": "text",
            "show_data_tab": true
          }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
        {% endfor %}
      ]
    }{% unless forloop.last %},{% endunless %}
  {% endfor %}
]
{% endcapture %}
{% liquid
  assign tags = tags | parse_json: raw_text: true
  return tags
%}
